  "comparison": "HTTP status, Content-Type, full parsed JSON including number spelling; direct Gson typed trees, UTF16 strings, member order and exact error messages/positions",
  "knownValidationBoundaries": [
    "Finite fixtures do not establish arbitrary Gson equivalence.",
    "The 288 raw-body requests all include a usable URL fallback query; malformed-body phase ordering without it is not represented by that matrix.",
    "Extreme nesting, arbitrary token/error combinations and long buffered-boundary inputs require further differential coverage.",
    "Final wire mapping of distinct surrogate-containing map keys that collapse to the same UTF8 key is not covered."
  ],
